// FN 1 and 2. TV: `Mismatched input "end of line without line continuation"
// expecting set "="` anchored at the END of the tuple - it parses a top-level
// `[...]` at statement start as a DESTRUCTURING TARGET and then wants `=`.
// Errors whether the tuple is final or not; this probe is the non-final form.
// We are clean.
//@version=6
indicator("toplevel nonfinal")
a = 1
b = 2
[a, b]
plot(a + b)
